{"seq":1,"slug":"polyrepo-to-monorepo","title":"多仓迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/migration-and-scale/polyrepo-to-monorepo","wordCount":781,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"多仓迁移\">多仓迁移</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Polyrepo → Monorepo 迁移围绕三种策略与两个技术支点展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大爆炸迁移</td>\n<td>一次性合并所有仓库</td>\n<td>仓库少、团队小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渐进式迁移</td>\n<td>分批逐步合并，每阶段可独立验证回滚</td>\n<td>仓库多、团队大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史保留（filter-repo）</td>\n<td>重写历史把旧仓库文件移入目标子目录</td>\n<td>保留完整 Git 历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖引用迁移</td>\n<td>把 npm 版本引用替换为 <code>workspace:*</code></td>\n<td>打通内部包的本地链接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心权衡是<strong>迁移风险与耗时</strong>：大爆炸迁移时间短但一次性变更大、风险高；渐进式迁移按依赖图拓扑顺序从底层包开始，每阶段可独立验证，适合大多数场景。技术难点集中在两处——保留 Git 历史（<code>git filter-repo</code> 比 <code>filter-branch</code> 快 100x+ 且更安全）与批量替换内部依赖引用，后者可脚本化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"迁移策略选择\">迁移策略选择</h2><p>从 Polyrepo 迁移到 Monorepo 有两种基本策略：<strong>大爆炸迁移</strong>（一次性合并所有仓库）和<strong>渐进式迁移</strong>（分批逐步合并）。选择哪种策略取决于团队规模、仓库数量和业务紧迫度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[迁移决策] --&gt; Q1{仓库数量?}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&lt; 5 个| BIG[大爆炸迁移&lt;br/&gt;一次性合并]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|5-20 个| GRADUAL[渐进式迁移&lt;br/&gt;分批合并]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&gt; 20 个| GRADUAL&#10;    BIG --&gt; SETUP[搭建 Monorepo 骨架]&#10;    GRADUAL --&gt; PHASE1[Phase 1: 核心包优先]&#10;    PHASE1 --&gt; PHASE2[Phase 2: 共享库迁入]&#10;    PHASE2 --&gt; PHASE3[Phase 3: 应用迁入]&#10;    SETUP --&gt; VERIFY[验证 + 切换]&#10;    PHASE3 --&gt; VERIFY\">flowchart TD\n    START[迁移决策] --&gt; Q1{仓库数量?}\n    Q1 --&gt;|&lt; 5 个| BIG[大爆炸迁移&lt;br/&gt;一次性合并]\n    Q1 --&gt;|5-20 个| GRADUAL[渐进式迁移&lt;br/&gt;分批合并]\n    Q1 --&gt;|&gt; 20 个| GRADUAL\n    BIG --&gt; SETUP[搭建 Monorepo 骨架]\n    GRADUAL --&gt; PHASE1[Phase 1: 核心包优先]\n    PHASE1 --&gt; PHASE2[Phase 2: 共享库迁入]\n    PHASE2 --&gt; PHASE3[Phase 3: 应用迁入]\n    SETUP --&gt; VERIFY[验证 + 切换]\n    PHASE3 --&gt; VERIFY</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大爆炸</td>\n<td>仓库少、团队小</td>\n<td>高（一次性变更大）</td>\n<td>短（1-2周）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渐进式</td>\n<td>仓库多、团队大</td>\n<td>低（分步验证）</td>\n<td>长（1-3月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合式</td>\n<td>核心包先合并，边缘包后迁</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"保留-git-历史\">保留 Git 历史</h2><p>迁移时保留 Git 历史是团队的常见需求。使用 <code>git subtree</code> 或 <code>git filter-repo</code> 可以将旧仓库的完整历史合并到 Monorepo 中：</p>\n<h3 id=\"方法一-git-subtree\">方法一：git subtree</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 创建 Monorepo 根仓库&#10;mkdir my-monorepo &amp;&amp; cd my-monorepo&#10;git init&#10;&#10;# 2. 添加旧仓库作为 remote&#10;git remote add ui-repo https://github.com/org/ui-lib.git&#10;git remote add utils-repo https://github.com/org/utils.git&#10;&#10;# 3. 使用 subtree 合并，保留历史&#10;git subtree add --prefix=packages/ui ui-repo main&#10;git subtree add --prefix=packages/utils utils-repo main&#10;&#10;# 4. 清理 remote&#10;git remote remove ui-repo&#10;git remote remove utils-repo\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 创建 Monorepo 根仓库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-monorepo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-monorepo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 添加旧仓库作为 remote</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ui-repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/ui-lib.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> utils-repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/utils.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 使用 subtree 合并，保留历史</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> subtree</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prefix=packages/ui</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ui-repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> subtree</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prefix=packages/utils</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> utils-repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4. 清理 remote</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remove</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ui-repo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remove</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> utils-repo</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方法二-git-filter-repo-推荐\">方法二：git filter-repo（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 克隆旧仓库&#10;git clone https://github.com/org/ui-lib.git ui-lib-temp&#10;cd ui-lib-temp&#10;&#10;# 2. 重写历史，将所有文件移动到目标子目录&#10;git filter-repo --to-subdirectory-filter packages/ui&#10;&#10;# 3. 在 Monorepo 中添加为 remote 并合并&#10;cd ../my-monorepo&#10;git remote add ui-temp ../ui-lib-temp&#10;git fetch ui-temp&#10;git merge ui-temp/main --allow-unrelated-histories&#10;git remote remove ui-temp\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 克隆旧仓库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/ui-lib.git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ui-lib-temp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ui-lib-temp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 重写历史，将所有文件移动到目标子目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> filter-repo</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --to-subdirectory-filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> packages/ui</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 在 Monorepo 中添加为 remote 并合并</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ../my-monorepo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ui-temp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ../ui-lib-temp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ui-temp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ui-temp/main</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --allow-unrelated-histories</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remove</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ui-temp</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>git filter-repo</code> 比 <code>git filter-branch</code> 快得多（100x+），且更安全。它是 Git 官方推荐的历史重写工具。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"渐进式迁移计划\">渐进式迁移计划</h2><p>渐进式迁移将整个过程分为多个阶段，每个阶段都可独立验证和回滚：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"gantt\" data-source=\"gantt&#10;    title 渐进式迁移计划&#10;    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD&#10;    section Phase 0: 准备&#10;    搭建 Monorepo 骨架       :a1, 2024-01-01, 5d&#10;    配置工具链               :a2, after a1, 3d&#10;    section Phase 1: 基础包&#10;    迁移 types               :b1, after a2, 2d&#10;    迁移 config              :b2, after b1, 2d&#10;    迁移 utils               :b3, after b2, 3d&#10;    验证 + 发布              :b4, after b3, 2d&#10;    section Phase 2: UI 层&#10;    迁移 ui                  :c1, after b4, 5d&#10;    更新依赖引用             :c2, after c1, 3d&#10;    验证 + 发布              :c3, after c2, 2d&#10;    section Phase 3: 应用&#10;    迁移 web                 :d1, after c3, 5d&#10;    迁移 admin               :d2, after d1, 5d&#10;    全量验证                 :d3, after d2, 3d\">gantt\n    title 渐进式迁移计划\n    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD\n    section Phase 0: 准备\n    搭建 Monorepo 骨架       :a1, 2024-01-01, 5d\n    配置工具链               :a2, after a1, 3d\n    section Phase 1: 基础包\n    迁移 types               :b1, after a2, 2d\n    迁移 config              :b2, after b1, 2d\n    迁移 utils               :b3, after b2, 3d\n    验证 + 发布              :b4, after b3, 2d\n    section Phase 2: UI 层\n    迁移 ui                  :c1, after b4, 5d\n    更新依赖引用             :c2, after c1, 3d\n    验证 + 发布              :c3, after c2, 2d\n    section Phase 3: 应用\n    迁移 web                 :d1, after c3, 5d\n    迁移 admin               :d2, after d1, 5d\n    全量验证                 :d3, after d2, 3d</pre><h3 id=\"phase-0-准备阶段\">Phase 0：准备阶段</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-monorepo&quot;,&#10;  &quot;private&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;packageManager&quot;: &quot;pnpm@9.15.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: &quot;turbo run build&quot;,&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: &quot;turbo run test&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lint&quot;: &quot;turbo run lint&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-monorepo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"private\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"packageManager\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm@9.15.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"turbo run build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"turbo run test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"turbo run lint\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# pnpm-workspace.yaml&#10;packages:&#10;  - &#39;apps/*&#39;&#10;  - &#39;packages/*&#39;&#10;  - &#39;tooling/*&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pnpm-workspace.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tooling/*'</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://turbo.build/schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tasks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;lint&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: []&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-da